          "t": "lead",
          "text": "I can use ‘faire’ to mean ‘go’ and for other present tense activities."
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "text": "You will also learn to recognise, write and pronounce [ch]."
        },
        {
          "t": "cards",
          "items": [
            {
              "title": "{faire} = do, make"
            },
            {
              "title": "{faire} = go"
            },
            {
              "title": "the {[ch]} sound"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
